ce:136178:61593:6592:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c25997","characterName":"大雲寺 エル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61594","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"136178"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3643"],"vndbCharacterId":"c25997"},"originalCharacterName":"大雲寺 エル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1224"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the daughter of the “Daiunji Zaibatsu” who built up a large conglomerate in the bio-industry. She has never had a problem with money, so she believes that everything that happens in the world can be solved with money."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her ability is to gain control over others. To activate it, the person must touch something she cast her ability on. Those who fall for it will do whatever she tells them to do. Because it is a very tricky ability, the process of setting it up is difficult, and she tends to solve it with money, because her parents told her that “everything\" is about money."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her ability can be weak without the proper knowledge, and when she encounters a situation where money is not an option, she gets upset and becomes irrational. To overcome this, she is sent to the \"special\" classroom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a high flier, and thinks that money is the most important thing in the world. She is quick to anger and quick to judge, however, once she likes you she is very devoted."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"P/A: Avarice"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Shopping for brand name items, spending money"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skill: Spending money"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Spending money, people who like her, sachertorte"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Dirty things, people who don't like her"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25997"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイオ産業で一大財閥を築き上げた『大雲寺財閥』の超お嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お金に困った事がないため、世の中で起こる全ての事象は何でもお金で解決できると思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の能力は『欲しい物に能力をかけ、それに触ると発動する』能力。それに掛かった者は、エルの言う事に従ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常にトリッキーな能力の為、仕掛け方のプロセスが難しく、それをエルはお金で解決してしまう傾向がある。なぜなら両親から『全ては金である』と幼少の頃から教わり、更に自分もその方法が間違っているとは微塵も思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして彼女は応用力が弱く、金の力が通用しない事態に陥った途端に動揺し、思考が停止してしまうらしく、それを克服するため『落ちこぼれ組』に入る事になった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3643","sourceWorkId":"20172","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイオ産業で一大財閥を築き上げた 大雲寺財閥の超お嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お金に困ったことが無いため、世の中の事象は何でもお金で解決できると思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の能力は 欲しいモノに能力を掛け、それに触ると発動する能力。 それに掛かった者はエルの言うことに従ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常にトリッキーな能力のためプロセスが難しく、それをエルはお金で解決してしまう傾向がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜなら両親から “全ては金である” と幼少の頃から教わり、さらに自分もその方法が間違っているとは微塵も思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして彼女は応用力が弱く、金の力が通用しない事態に陥った途端に動揺し、思考が停止してしまうらしく、それを克服するため “落ちこぼれ組” に入ることになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はぁ……まったく、やれやれですわ……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61594"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61594","value":"自分を好む人間、ザッハトルテ、他"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61594","value":"汚い・臭いもの、自分を嫌う人間、他"},{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61594","value":"3年生"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61594","val