"vndb","value":"831"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was scouted as a model after a friend sent her photo to a fashion magazine without her permission, and moved to Tokyo from a small town. She quickly made her mark, selling magazine covers, selling photo books, and selling her own brand of clothing. However, despite the glamour of her life, she was often frustrated by the stresses of human relationships and the ugliness she saw in people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The emotions that she suppressed through the accumulation of such daily experiences awakened her latent P/A abilities. Her ability is powerful, she was not able to control it immediately and began to hurt those around her regardless of whether she wanted to or not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result, bad rumors began to circulate, and she was unable to continue her modeling career. The headmaster of the school, Jougasaki, couldn't bear to see this happen, so she was transferred to her school and, of her own volition, ended up studying in the \"special\" classroom."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is cool and doesn't talk much, she is popular with the other female students. Despite her appearance, she likes cute things."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"P/A: Mental damage"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: collecting weapon accessories, pretty things and shoes"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skill: Posing"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Cute things, metallic things, spiked bats"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: sweet things, carbohydrates, slugs"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25998"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"友達がファッション雑誌へ写真を送りモデルとしてスカウトされ、小さな町から上京してきた。そしてすぐに頭角を表し、表紙を飾った雑誌は売れ、写真集やオリジナルブランドの服が販売されるほどの人気になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし華やかに見えたその生活も、人間関係などのストレスが多く、人の醜い部分も多く見るようになり苛立つ事も多々あった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな毎日の積み重ねで、抑えつけられた感情が潜在能力者であった澪亜を覚醒させてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、能力値は高いもののすぐに扱い切れるわけもなく、形振り構わず周りを傷つけ始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果、悪い噂が立ち始め、モデル業も続けられなくなり今は休業している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを見かねた城ヶ崎学園長が自分の学園へと編入させ、本人の意志により『落ちこぼれ組』で学ぶ事になった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3644","sourceWorkId":"20172","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3644","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"175 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3644","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3644","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3644","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"58 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3644","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/39c0347256704ed3454e04da37510a43b54836e42e54cd4f4703c9dcf66579c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52f77e3cf97559d361fd14aaa0ec34e06c461c40b46131cfe2fdeeb4666fc071.webp","width":94,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立石めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vnd