well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first glance, she appears to be the serious student council type, but in reality she has nothing in her head but sex. She is honest about her desires and often misplaces her glasses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"P/A: Nymphomania"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: shopping and cooking"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skills: skillful blowjobs, boobjobs, handjobs, and sex"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"likes: Sex"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"dislikes: Not feeling good"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25999"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心がとても強く、心が子供のまま身体だけが大きくなってしまっているような女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を差別する事がなく誰にでも分け隔てなく接するが、その一方で天然な部分もあり『実は何も考えていないのでは？』と周りから思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして性に対してとても興味があり、ＳＥＸで気持ち良ければ何でも体験したいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鈴音がこうなってしまった切っ掛けは、幼い時にＨなデータを見過ぎていたため。それ以来、常に性的な何かを求めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に没頭し過ぎて能力者として覚醒したその能力は、彼女の気持ちを代弁するかのように身体から噴き出し、それを浴びてしまった者と自由にエッチができるようになった。しかもそんな状態を鈴音は悪い事だと思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結果、能力をうまくコントロール出来ていないと言う理由で『落ちこぼれ組』に入れられる事になった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3645","sourceWorkId":"20172","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心がとても強く、心が子供のまま身体だけが大きくなってしまっているような女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を差別することがなく誰にでも分け隔てなく接するが、その一方で天然な部分もあり 「実は何も考えていないのでは？」 と周りから思われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして性に対してとても興味があり、SEXで気持ち良ければなんでも体験したいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鈴音がこうなってしまった切っ掛けは、幼い頃にエッチなデータを見過ぎていたため。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それ以来、常に性的な何かを求めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性に没頭し過ぎて覚醒したその能力は、彼女の気持ちを代弁するかのように身体から噴き出し、それを浴びてしまった者と自由にエッチができるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかもそんな状態を鈴音は悪いことだと思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結果、能力をうまくコントロール出来ていないという理由で “落ちこぼれ組” に入れられることになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あっ、もしかしてせんせぇって童貞ですか～？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61595"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61595","value":"SEX"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61595","value":"気持ち良くないこと"},{"label":"学年","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61595","value":"1年生"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61595","value":"性技・SEXが上手い"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61595","value":"服を買う、料理を作る"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"96 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3645","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3645","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3645","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"61 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3645","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"52 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3645","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edd50ec15c3ed247822ec67f319f6db1530ae185af5139f5b2671c74aa8e974b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3079e146ea1bdaae8addba5590ec96ff6673b81018689cfe49c2aed5b6601ed.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:136178:61595:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35854","characterName":"光ちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["3648"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35854"},"originalCharacterName":"光ちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"606"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A university student seeking to get his teaching license. When looking for a place to do his practicum, he was invited to Jougasaki academy. Since the school focuses on training people with P/A, he feels out of place and prefers a more ordinary school. However, as long he obtains his license he'll take his training at the academy seriously."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a serious person and has been studying hard his whole life. Because of this, he has no experience with women. He's never been in a relationship with a woman and would like the opportunity to be with one as much as anyone else."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When he first arrives at the school, he finds that the class he is assigned to for practical training is full of so-called dropouts, and he begins to think that he is not up to the task."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His parents died when he was very young because of a crime committed by someone with P/A, he was raised by his maternal aunt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a sense of justice but is sometimes unable to take action. He is earnest, kind and easily moved by emotions."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"P/A: Incompetent"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Listening to music, watching movies, going out for walks, cooking"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skill: None"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Nothing in particular"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Nothing in particular"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35854"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教員免許の取得を目指す大学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"資格を得るための実習先を探していたところ、城ヶ崎学園に招かれた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力者育成を中心とした学園のため、本人としては『もっと普通のところが良かった』という思いがある。しかし、実習修了書を得られれば問題はないので、真剣に取り組もうと心に誓っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目な性格で、今まで勉強一直線にやってきたところがある。そのため、女性に対する免疫は皆無に等しい。女性と交際したこともないため、人並みにそうした機会を得たいとは思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして学園にきて早々、実習を担当することになったクラスはいわゆる落ちこぼれの集まりであり、自分には無理だと思い始めるのだが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに彼の両親は、幼い頃に能力者の起こした犯罪に巻き込まれて死亡しており、育ての親は母方の伯母である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3648","sourceWorkId":"20172","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"172 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3648","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/843e902d74e1d05e9272f18aef21604abff7c21a705d0461e4b36d5d05cd1f94.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f019af56ee39ef8c95e653c2d3aea5c9f846d40456289cb2aa6ecaf12934435f.webp","width":222,"height":226,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c46944","characterName":"鋒之原 虎太狼","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"61597","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"136178"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3647"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46944"},"originalCharacterName":"鋒之原 虎太狼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"229"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the son of a rich and wealthy family with connections to the Daiunji Zaibatsu. Naturally, he's never had issues with money and has been playing around with women since a young age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He views women as nothing more than tools for his sexual gratification, he comes up with schemes to get any girl he likes. His personality is perhaps directly related to his abilities. He believes himself to be untouchable."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is acquainted with the principal of the school, and in his heart, he is determined to win her for himself, but in terms of power, the principal is the most powerful, so he is unable to take her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has the appearance of a host, and is a rich brat who is always gnawing on his parents' shins. He throws tantrums when he is not free to do what he wants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"P/A: Reflector"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Sports, driving"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special Skills: Karate, sleight of hand, badger games, tricking people"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Humiliated faces, crying women"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Confident people, people who talk back, informal language"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46944"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大雲寺財閥にも通じている金持ちの資産家の息子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろん、お金に困ったことがあるはずもなく、かなり若い頃から女遊びも盛んに行ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女は性欲処理の道具としか考えていない一方、気に入った女は絶対手に入れようと画策することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性格が能力と直結したのか、手が付けられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長とは顔見知り程度の仲で、心の中では必ず自分のものにしようと考えているが、能力の力関係で言えば学園長が最強過ぎるため、手出しが出来ないでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3647","sourceWorkId":"20172","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大雲寺財閥にも通じている金持ちの資産家の息子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もちろんお金に困ったことがあるはずもなく、かなり若い頃から女遊びも盛んに行ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女は性欲処理の道具としか考えていない一方、気に入った女は絶対手に入れようと画策することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな性格が能力と直結したのか、手が付けられない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園長とは顔見知り程度の仲で、心の中では必ず自分のものにしようと考えているが、能力の力関係でいえば学園長が最強過ぎるため、手出しが出来ないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「俺の気分を損ねるようなことをしたら、親父に言いつけてやるからな」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61597"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61597","value":"屈辱的な顔、女性の泣き顔"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61597","value":"自信満々の顔、口答え、タメ口"},{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61597","value":"空手、流し眼、美人局、人を陥れること"},{"label":"職業","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61597","value":"資産家の息子"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"61597","value":"スポーツ、ドライブ"},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"178 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3647","sourceWorkId":"20172","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/00b1f8ffb5023d8fb433988d2a460aa64dadb1a2333c11afa95f7b73b027dc03.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a697b7fb8d2f15ab93011fe8781b279e976d3bc54777457f88f4505df3a71699.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"原田友貴","creatorId":"vndb:s34","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s34","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s34","name":"原田 友貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:136178:61597:18219:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c26000","characterName":"城ヶ崎 三月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c26000"},"originalCharacterName":"城ヶ崎 三月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"322"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"176"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"At first glance, she looks like \"weirdo,\" but her supermodel-like looks neutralizes the \"weirdo\" part. Despite her appearances she is a very good principal and is loved by all teachers, students and anyone else involved with her because she treats everyone with kindness and respect."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also has a laissez-faire attitude, and tends to let things happen as long as they do not become a problem. Although it is difficult for people to understand her policies, she cares about her students. She always does her best to protect the school and its students by eliminating any negative influences."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also a rare \"multi ability master\". She has the ability to take the abilities of others and use them herself. It is by no exaggeration that she is the most powerful person in the world. It is also by coincidence that she saved Mihara Aika from her abilities going out of control."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whilst being extremely beautiful with an eccentric style of fashion, she can be a little self-conscious. She has thick lips and looks at people with a sense of flirtation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"P/A: Deprive"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: It's a secret"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Special skill: Confidential"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Likes what she likes"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Dislikes what she dislikes"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26000"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3fa1c463eca8a3304a9d4fb37ca9d0300385f63afd1fa46c0f76fe9ac14ca5a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8be32fc